### 1. Crear el evento (estado inicial: DRAFT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventCode": "CMF-2026",
  "name": "Caribbean Music Fest 2026",
  "description": "Festival musical de prueba para el taller",
  "category": "MUSIC",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-15T18:00:00",
  "minimumAge": 18,
  "venueCode": "VEN-SMR-01"
}

### 2. Asociar Solar Beat (los artistas de referencia se insertan en orden, ID 1 a 5)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/CMF-2026/artists/1

### 3. Asociar Neon Waves
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/CMF-2026/artists/2

### 4. Asociar Caribbean Sound
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/CMF-2026/artists/3

### 5. Publicar el evento
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/events/CMF-2026/publish

### 6. Comprar entrada GENERAL para Andrea
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userEmail": "andrea@email.com",
  "eventCode": "CMF-2026",
  "type": "GENERAL"
}

### 7. Consultar eventos publicados
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/published

### 8. Consultar entradas pagadas del evento
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/CMF-2026/tickets/paid

### 9. Consultar el usuario de prueba
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/by-email?email=andrea@email.com
